Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 03:52:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: use Taskmandu employee emails for auto-nudges

- TaskmanduSync::listEmployees() now returns each employee's email (emailOf tries email/officialEmail/workEmail/companyEmail/personalEmail and an expanded user object)
- AutomationService resolves nudge recipients from Taskmandu; addresses saved by hand still override
- Auto-nudge review rows show the recipient or a warning when no email exists
- Nudge emails honour PM_REPLY_TO
- Email modal contacts pre-fill from Taskmandu
